  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk_b3994309",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《格洛犸图奔腾的原野》节选一",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_18e5211f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0e71a88e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "罗伊人来自地表，来自万千年前奔腾着格洛犸图与格洛犸提的原野。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_69fde98a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在寒带的峡湾中，他们的祖先以游牧为生，直至如今，牧人的天赋仍流淌在他们的血脉中。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d8165cf1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在罗伊族中，有牧者，昭日者以及秘日六席这三大特殊身份。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aab41c69",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "被日灵认可的罗伊人，将成为引导日灵的“牧羊人”，获得引导隧群繁衍生息的职责。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f0ddb963",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而在筹算历法方面具备天赋，并与日灵和隧者具备一定程度共感能力的人，才能步入引日殿，成为昭日者的一员，他们同时也是秘日六席的候选人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_382f1f78",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "可以看到，被日灵与隧群认可，是成为牧者，昭日者以及秘日六席的必要条件。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f62059be",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在罗伊人心中，日灵，隧群，乃至拉海洛的万物生灵都至关重要——对生命的尊重，对隧者献出炉芯造就的天地的尊重，是每个罗伊人成年时的必修课。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d59ed3ff",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1cf1ff55",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在拉海洛的地下空洞中，浮光林是少有的不受虚质磁暴影响的地区，基于这一性质，罗伊人在此处修建了引日殿。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_06301e5d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "平日里，罗伊人引导隧群成长、迁徙，而在虚质磁暴高的时期，罗伊人则会休牧，带领它们聚集于引日殿避难。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9692099b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "当隧群完全长成之际，它们将亲历迁徙，最终回归冰原上的隧者，以对隧者的身躯进行修复。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c814ea8b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "引日殿除了承担着保管隧群部件的职责，也是罗伊人的数据与记录的集散中心。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6635aa5d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "各个聚落的罗伊人会将自己记录的观测数据带往此处，并交给秘日六席以及辅佐的昭日者汇总计算。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c0bda960",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在每一季，炉芯的运转是否稳定，有多少隧群新生、长成，又有多少最终回归了隧者的身体，都在引日殿的测算之内。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d695b560",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "信息汇总后，秘日六席将结合炉芯的运转状态测定下一季的历法，以此引导罗伊族未来生活或工作的重心。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5c00b25a",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《格洛犸图奔腾的原野》节选二",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3d70779f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f99563f3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "隧群是隧者躯体碎片分化而成的拟态机械，是修复和重构隧者的必备因素。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b7eb9df9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "为了帮助隧者，罗伊族千百年如一日地引导着隧群攀上冰原，向着隧者的沉眠地进发。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_677e6028",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在联运椎骨建成前，罗伊族必须在高不可攀的陡峭崖壁上跋涉。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1d39d9ac",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "冰原外沿的悬崖锐利险峻，有时还会形成大于九十度的不可能倒角——这条险途被罗伊人称为“天梯”。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 24,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 25,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_51cbf44f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在终于攀上冰原后，格洛犸图与格洛犸提便会映入罗伊人的眼帘。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9430dc83",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这种强大的隧群会护送罗伊人，并与其他隧群一起回归隧者的躯体。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 26,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 27,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b483006f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在罗伊族的神话中充满了新旧交替的概念，而他们也以此来诠释自己以及周身的万物：",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ac57e357",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "亘古以前，格洛犸图的祖先，巨大的象族动物在这片原野上肆意奔腾，将族群的生命延续。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 28,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 29,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c54382c1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而如今，隧群踏破冰雪，将被给予的生命交还给自己的创造者。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 29,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 30,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_27e11c67",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 30,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 31,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}